  "Coordinate Geometry":"Geometry expressed through coordinate systems and equations.",
  "Trigonometry":"Angles, periodic functions and geometric relationships.",
  "Precalculus":"The function and limit foundations used before formal calculus.",
  "Calculus":"Limits, rates of change, accumulation and infinite processes.",
